.TH FILEINFO 1 "2026-10-24" "cools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fileinfo \- report line count, size and type per file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fileinfo
[\fIDIRECTORY\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Recursively scan a directory and print line count, byte size and text/binary type.
.SH OUTPUT
LINES<TAB>BYTES<TAB>TYPE<TAB>PATH
.SH EXAMPLES
fileinfo .
.SH SEE ALSO
bigfiles(1), changed(1), contextpack(1)
